== opencollection.yml
opencollection: 1.0.0

info:
  name: Template Tag Collection
bundled: false
extensions:
  bruno:
    ignore:
      - node_modules
      - .git
    presets:
      defaultEnvironment: Base Environment
-- report
NeedsInput Cookie Tag Error / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% cookie 'http://127.0.0.1:4010/echo', 'does-not-exist' %}` as `{{cookie}}`; give `cookie` a value before sending (Cookie Tag Error.yml)
NeedsInput File Tag Error / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% file '/path/does/not/exist/nope.txt' %}` as `{{file}}`; give `file` a value before sending (File Tag Error.yml)
NeedsInput Prompt Tag Masked / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% prompt 'masked prompt test', 'Enter secret', '', 'masked-prompt-key', true, false %}` as `{{prompt}}`; give `prompt` a value before sending (Prompt Tag Masked.yml)
NeedsInput External Vault Tag / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% vault 'aws', '', '{}' %}` as `{{vault}}`, `{% vault 'gcp', '', '{}' %}` as `{{vault}}`, `{% vault 'hashicorp', '', '{}' %}` as `{{vault}}`; give `vault` a value before sending (External Vault Tag.yml)
NeedsInput Prompt Tag / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% prompt 'prompt test', '', 'test', 'insomnia-test', false, true %}` as `{{prompt}}`; give `prompt` a value before sending (Prompt Tag.yml)
NeedsInput Response Trigger Always / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% response 'body', 'req_60295920e8a9459fb32cacb739a261f6', 'b64::JC5pZA==::46b', 'always', 60 %}` as `{{response}}`; give `response` a value before sending (Response Trigger Always.yml)
NeedsInput Response Trigger When Expired / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% response 'body', 'req_60295920e8a9459fb32cacb739a261f6', 'b64::JC5pZA==::46b', 'when-expired', 0 %}` as `{{response}}`; give `response` a value before sending (Response Trigger When Expired.yml)
NeedsInput Response Trigger No History / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% response 'body', 'req_60295920e8a9459fb32cacb739a261f6', 'b64::JC5pZA==::46b', 'no-history', 60 %}` as `{{response}}`; give `response` a value before sending (Response Trigger No History.yml)
NeedsInput Response Trigger Never / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% response 'body', 'req_60295920e8a9459fb32cacb739a261f6', 'b64::JC5pZA==::46b', 'never', 60 %}` as `{{response}}`; give `response` a value before sending (Response Trigger Never.yml)
NeedsInput Response Tag / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% response 'body', 'req_60295920e8a9459fb32cacb739a261f5', 'b64::JC5tZXRob2Q=::46b', 'never', 60 %}` as `{{response}}`, `{% response 'header', 'req_60295920e8a9459fb32cacb739a261f5', 'b64::Y29udGVudC10eXBl::46b', 'never', 60 %}` as `{{response}}`, `{% response 'url', 'req_60295920e8a9459fb32cacb739a261f5', '', 'never', 60 %}` as `{{response}}`; give `response` a value before sending (Response Tag.yml)
NeedsInput Common Tag / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% base64 'encode', 'normal', 'insomnia-test' %}` as `{{base64}}`, `{% base64 'decode', 'normal', 'aW5zb21uaWEtdGVzdA==' %}` as `{{base64}}`, `{% faker 'guid' %}` as `{{faker}}`, `{% file '__TEMPLATE_TAG_FILE_PATH' %}` as `{{file}}`, `{% hash 'md5', 'hex', 'insomnia-test' %}` as `{{hash}}`, `{% os 'arch', '' %}` as `{{os}}`, `{% jsonpath '{"foo":"bar"}', 'b64::JC5mb28=::46b' %}` as `{{jsonpath}}`, `{% now 'millis', '' %}` as `{{now}}`, `{% uuid 'v4' %}` as `{{uuid}}`, `{% cookie 'http://127.0.0.1/echo', 'from' %}` as `{{cookie}}`; give `base64`, `faker`, `file`, `hash`, `os`, `jsonpath`, `now`, `uuid`, `cookie` a value before sending (Common Tag.yml)
NeedsInput FolderWithRequest / Request Tag / body.text: a template tag has no equivalent, so each is written as a variable: `{% request 'name', '', '' %}` as `{{request}}`, `{% request 'folder', '', '' %}` as `{{request}}`, `{% request 'url', '', '' %}` as `{{request}}`, `{% request 'parameter', 'foo', '' %}` as `{{request}}`, `{% request 'cookie', 'from', '' %}` as `{{request}}`; give `request` a value before sending (FolderWithRequest/Request Tag.yml)
Converted FolderWithRequest / Request Tag / authentication: `oauth2` authentication is not supported; set to none (FolderWithRequest/Request Tag.yml)
Dropped collection / cookieJar: cookies are not imported
Converted collection: runs use the environment `Base Environment` by default, as the first environment imported (opencollection.yml)
